iments: recency_s025, recency_s030, gpqa_ds_importance_s020, and gpqa_ds_importance_s025. Looking back at gpqa_ds_importance_s015, it showed a median gradient ratio of 75.2× with a monotonic direction pattern (low > mid > high) and passed. For the best tier predictions, I expect recency_s025 and recency_s030 to both show null phase gradients, while gpqa_ds_importance_s020 should demonstrate monotonic behavior.\n\nNow I'm reviewing what other experiments might be in the pipeline—C11 needs confirmation at s025 and s030 for recency, and GPQA requires testing across multiple sparsity levels. I'm also checking whether there's a planned random condition for GPQA or if strategy specificity measurements are being tracked. Looking at the best tier metrics, I need to verify the target ranges: recency_s025 and recency_s030 should fall within specific effect size bounds, gpqa_s015's median gradient is already at 0.96 which fits the expected range, and I'm looking for strategy specificity ratios that meet the 3.0 to 10 threshold.\n\nThe pending experiments I need to make predictions for are recency at s025 and s030, gpqa_ds_importance at s020 and s025, and potentially some GPQA random conditions to establish the strategy specificity ratio. For recency_s025, I'm extrapolating from the s015 baseline where the effect size was 0.083 with a non-significant p-value, so I'd expect a slightly larger effect at the higher sparsity level.\n\nFor recency_s030, the pattern continues with a null effect since recency eviction fundamentally doesn't leverage attention scores. On the GPQA side, I'm using the MATH-500 scaling pattern where moving from s015 to s020 shows roughly a 3× increase in median gradient—so with GPQA's s015 low median at 0.96, I'd project s020 to land around 2.5-3.5, and s025 would follow a similar multiplicative jump from there.\n\nTo determine if this supports the best tier for strategy specificity, I need to pull the GPQA random baseline and compute the ratio—if it's ≥3×, that strengthens the case. Now I'm assembling the full YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58727,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58727},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cfd87b54-90b3-4c17-a025-1a70c61bd83b","uuid":"b8d6cf57-cb5b-47b7-ad91-3534005a021c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01SLPAFRfchACSNeH7C2koRP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"原始 framing 完全成立。Recency control 在 s025/s030 均确认 null phase gradient，完成 triple dissociation 的全 sparsity range 验证，排除所有 circularity/confound 质疑。GPQA cross-benchmark 展示 importance gradient 单调递增且 strategy specificity ratio ≥ 3×，进一步强化 phase-modulated compound severity 的跨 benchmark 泛化。Paper 三支柱叙事（empirical discovery + novel experimental design + mechanistic explanation）全部站稳，claims 无需降级。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"recency_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"C11_recency_s025\"\n    description: \"Recency-based eviction (scoring-independent control) at sparsity=0.25, n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B. 验证 recency eviction 在中等 sparsity 下仍无 phase gradient。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 100\n      model: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n      masking_method: \"recency\"\n      sparsity: 0.25\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.018\n      phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.11\n      phase_gradient_p_value: 0.42\n      significant: false\n      low_phase_ii_median: 0.87\n      high_phase_ii_median: 0.82\n      low_high_ratio: 1.06\n      low_high_ratio_ci: [-0.08, 2.21]\n      comparison_importance_s025_median_diff: 3.99\n      comparison_importance_s025_dz: 0.95\n      comparison_random_s025_median_diff: 0.26\n      comparison_random_s025_dz: 0.12\n      triple_dissociation: \"importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=0.95), recency NS (d_z=0.11), random NS (d_z=0.12)\"\n      imp_vs_recency_ratio: \"36×\"\n    result_rationale: \"Recency eviction 按 token 到达顺序驱逐最旧 token，完全不涉及 attention score 计算。因此 head pruning 导致的 score discrimination collapse 对 recency 无影响——pruning 后 recency 仍按同一确定性规则驱逐，不存在 importance score 退化为伪随机的路径。在 s025 下虽然 absolute perplexity 升高（因更多有效 token 被移除），但 low-phase 和 high-phase 受到的 compound interaction 增量近似相等，因为 recency 对两个 phase 的 eviction pattern 与 attention distribution 无关。d_z 略高于 s015 的 0.083 是因为更高 sparsity 下 noise floor 略增，但仍远低于 0.2 阈值且统计不显著。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Triple dissociation at s025 — Importance d_z=0.95 (p<1e-50), Recency d_z=0.11 (p=0.42, NS), Random d_z=0.12 (p=0.38, NS)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Paired median difference distribution (bootstrap B=10000) for three strategies at s025, showing importance distribution far from zero while recency and random center on zero\"\n    analysis: \"s025 recency null 结果与 s015 一致，排除了 'recency 可能在高 sparsity 下出现 phase gradient' 的替代假设。Triple dissociation 在 s025 完整复现：attention-score-based eviction (importance) 产生强 phase gradient，而 scoring-independent (recency) 和 structure-independent (random) 均为 null。这确认 phase-dependent severity 是 attention score pathway 的特有效应。\"\n\n  - name: \"recency_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"C11_recency_s030\"\n    description: \"Recency-based eviction at sparsity=0.30, n=100. 最高 sparsity 下确认 recency null gradient，完成全 sparsity range triple dissociation。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 100\n      model: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n      masking_method: \"recency\"\n      sparsity: 0.30\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.041\n      phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.15\n      phase_gradient_p_value: 0.28\n      significant: false\n      low_phase_ii_median: 1.52\n      high_phase_ii_median: 1.38\n      low_high_ratio: 1.10\n      low_high_ratio_ci: [-0.15, 3.34]\n      comparison_importance_s030_median_diff: 8.48\n      comparison_importance_s030_dz: 1.13\n      comparison_random_s030_median_diff: 0.51\n      comparison_random_s030_dz: 0.18\n      triple_dissociation: \"importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=1.13), recency NS (d_z=0.15), random borderline (d_z=0.18 NS)\"\n      imp_vs_recency_ratio: \"207×\"\n    result_rationale: \"s030 是测试的最高 sparsity，此时 30% head 被 pruned + 30% KV 被 evicted。Recency eviction 的 compound interaction 绝对值升高（因为移除更多 token 导致 perplexity 整体恶化），但 phase gradient 仍为 null——原因不变：recency 驱逐决策与 attention score distribution 完全解耦，head pruning 不改变 recency 的 eviction 目标选择。d_z=0.15 接近但仍在 0.2 阈值内，反映高 sparsity 下更大的 measurement noise（fewer effective tokens per segment, higher variance）。重要的是，importance 在同一 sparsity 下 d_z=1.13 是 recency 的 7.5×，定量确认效应来源是 scoring mechanism 而非 token removal 本身。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Full sparsity range triple dissociation summary — s015/s025/s030 × importance/recency/random, 9 cells, only 3 importance cells significant\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: d_z vs sparsity for three strategies, showing importance monotonically increasing (0.57→0.95→1.13) while recency stays flat near zero (0.08→0.11→0.15) and random stays flat (−0.05→0.12→0.18)\"\n    analysis: \"s030 是 recency control 的最严格测试——如果 phase gradient 是 segmentation artifact 或 trivial token-removal 效应，在最高 sparsity 下应该最容易显现。但 d_z 仍仅 0.15（negligible），而 importance 已达 1.13（large）。这构成决定性证据：phase-dependent compound severity 完全归因于 attention-score-based eviction 的 discrimination collapse pathway，recency control 作为 methodological innovation 成功排除了所有已知 confound。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"GPQA_cross_benchmark_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s020, n=198. 验证 GPQA 上 phase gradient 从 s015 单调递增。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      interaction_index_high_median: 0.038\n      interaction_index_mid_median: 0.31\n      interaction_index_low_median: 2.85\n      median_difference: 2.81\n      median_difference_ci: [2.45, 3.28]\n      wilcoxon_p: \"<1e-30\"\n      cohens_dz: 0.92\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high (monotonic)\"\n      median_ratio_low_high: 75.0\n      pass_fail: \"PASS\"\n      perplexity_high_both: 2.95\n      perplexity_mid_both: 8.6\n      perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA-Diamond 的推理链比 MATH-500 更长（n_tokens ~1.2M vs ~62K for 50 problems），且更依赖 multi-hop 推理，导致 low-sparsity phase（深度推理阶段）对 attention pattern 精度更敏感。在 MATH-500 上 DS s015→s020 median_diff 从 0.39 升至 1.21（3.1×），GPQA s015 的 low_median 已为 0.96。按照相似的增长模式但考虑 GPQA 问题更高的认知复杂度（多步推理更易受 compound interaction 影响），s020 low_median 预计达 2.85（~3.0× from s015）。GPQA 的 phase gradient 更强是因为 long-chain reasoning 在 low-sparsity phase 集中了更多依赖 precise attention routing 的 computation。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GPQA DS importance dose-response: s015 median_low=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.1 (monotonic)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA vs MATH-500 dose-response curve comparison, showing parallel monotonic increase with GPQA absolute values reflecting longer reasoning chains\"\n    analysis: \"s020 结果确认 GPQA 上 importance phase gradient 的单调递增延续。绝对值比 MATH-500 同条件更大（2.85 vs 1.21），反映 GPQA 问题的推理链更长、更依赖 attention routing 精度。增长倍率 ~3.0× 与 MATH-500 一致（3.1×），表明 dose-response 动力学跨 benchmark 稳健。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"GPQA_cross_benchmark_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s025, n=198. 完成 GPQA 三点 dose-response 并计算 strategy specificity ratio。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      interaction_index_high_median: 0.095\n      interaction_index_mid_median: 0.98\n      interaction_index_low_median: 8.12\n      median_difference: 8.03\n      median_difference_ci: [6.85, 9.42]\n      wilcoxon_p: \"<1e-40\"\n      cohens_dz: 1.08\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high (monotonic)\"\n      median_ratio_low_high: 85.5\n      pass_fail: \"PASS\"\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_s015_s020_s025: [0.96, 2.85, 8.12]\n      growth_factors: [2.97, 2.85]\n      gpqa_strategy_specificity_ratio: 4.2\n      perplexity_high_both: 4.8\n      perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 95.6\n    result_rationale: \"s025 在 MATH-500 上 DS median_diff=3.99（s020 的 3.3×），GPQA 按相似倍率从 s020 的 2.85 增长至 ~8.1。Strategy specificity ratio（importance/random gradient）在 GPQA 上预计为 4.2×——高于 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× 但低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×。原因：GPQA 推理链长度和复杂度介于 GSM8K（短链算术）和 MATH-500（中等链证明）之间的某种模式——GPQA 的 multi-hop retrieval-heavy reasoning 使 random eviction 也产生一定 phase sensitivity（因长上下文中 random 移除的绝对信息量更大），但 importance 的 discrimination collapse 效应仍主导。Ratio ≥ 3× 满足 best tier 标准。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-benchmark strategy specificity comparison — MATH-500: 15-17×, GPQA: 4.2×, GSM8K: 2.3-3.8×\"\n      - \"Table: GPQA full dose-response: s015=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.12 (Spearman ρ=1.0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response overlay (MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K) normalized by task reasoning-chain length, showing universal monotonic increase with task-dependent scaling\"\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity ratio vs task complexity, showing gradient from GSM8K (low, short chains) through GPQA (medium, multi-hop) to MATH-500 (high, proof-style)\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA s025 完成了第三个 benchmark 的 dose-response 确认。Strategy specificity ratio 4.2× 处于 best tier 范围 [3.0, 10.0] 内，且提供了一个关键的 intermediate data point：specificity ratio 与 task-level reasoning demands 正相关。这支持了 Discussion 中 'strategy specificity 是 task 推理结构的函数' 的解释——GSM8K 的短算术链让 random 也能产生 phase effect（ratio 低），MATH-500 的结构化证明最依赖 precise attention routing（ratio 高），GPQA 居中。Phase gradient 本身（单调递增）跨所有三个 benchmark 完全一致，确认这是 robust empirical finding。\"\n\n  - name: \"reviewer_evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_scoring\"\n    description: \"模拟 EMNLP reviewer 评分，基于完整实验证据链评估 paper 的 empirical finding + experimental design novelty + mechanistic explanation 三支柱。\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_avg_score: 3.7\n      reviewer_novelty_score: 3.8\n      reviewer_1:\n        overall: 3.5\n        novelty: 4.0\n        soundness: 3.5\n        comment: \"The triple dissociation using recency control is a genuinely novel experimental design. Architecture-dependent specificity is interesting rather than limiting.\"\n      reviewer_2:\n        overall: 4.0\n        novelty: 3.5\n        soundness: 4.0\n        comment: \"Thorough empirical work with strong statistical methodology. Cross-benchmark validation convincing. Minor concern: 7B scale only.\"\n      reviewer_3:\n        overall: 3.5\n        novelty: 4.0\n        soundness: 3.5\n        comment: \"Experimental design contribution (recency control) is the strongest novelty. Discrimination collapse explanation adequate but would benefit from causal intervention in future work.\"\n    result_rationale: \"Best tier 假设 reviewer 认可三个层面：(1) Empirical finding — 三模型两架构三 benchmark 泛化，n=500 高功效，全方向一致，reviewer 无法质疑数据质量；(2) Experimental design — recency control 作为 scoring-independent methodological control 无文献先例（H2O/StreamingLLM 仅用 recency 作 performance baseline），triple dissociation 全 sparsity range 成立，这是 reviewer 最容易认可的创新点；(3) Mechanism — discrimination collapse 通过 Gini/CV 跨模型一致下降得到支持，reviewer 接受 'sufficient mechanistic explanation without requiring causal intervention' 是合理的，因为 empirical finding paper 不需要 intervention 实验。3.7 均分反映：一位 reviewer 给 4.0（被数据量和实验设计说服），两位给 3.5（对 scale limitation 和 causal gap 有保留但不构成 reject 理由）。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Reviewer 共识：(a) recency control 的 experimental design novelty 被明确认可，(b) architecture-dependent specificity 被接受为 interesting finding 而非 weakness（因为论文诚实声明且提供了 quantitative characterization），(c) discrimination collapse 作为 mechanistic explanation 被视为 sufficient（不要求 causal intervention），(d) 7B scale limitation 被 acknowledged 但不构成 rejection 理由因为有三模型两架构三 benchmark 覆盖。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58727,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58727},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cfd87b54-90b3-4c17-a025-1a70c61bd83b","uuid":"1129d5ef-2ca4-41cf-92f9-5521c38c800a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":127997,"duration_api_ms":130058,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"原始 framing 完全成立。Recency control 在 s025/s030 均确认 null phase gradient，完成 triple dissociation 的全 sparsity range 验证，排除所有 circularity/confound 质疑。GPQA cross-benchmark 展示 importance gradient 单调递增且 strategy specificity ratio ≥ 3×，进一步强化 phase-modulated compound severity 的跨 benchmark 泛化。Paper 三支柱叙事（empirical discovery + novel experimental design + mechanistic explanation）全部站稳，claims 无需降级。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"recency_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"C11_recency_s025\"\n    description: \"Recency-based eviction (scoring-independent control) at sparsity=0.25, n=100, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B. 验证 recency eviction 在中等 sparsity 下仍无 phase gradient。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 100\n      model: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n      masking_method: \"recency\"\n      sparsity: 0.25\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.018\n      phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.11\n      phase_gradient_p_value: 0.42\n      significant: false\n      low_phase_ii_median: 0.87\n      high_phase_ii_median: 0.82\n      low_high_ratio: 1.06\n      low_high_ratio_ci: [-0.08, 2.21]\n      comparison_importance_s025_median_diff: 3.99\n      comparison_importance_s025_dz: 0.95\n      comparison_random_s025_median_diff: 0.26\n      comparison_random_s025_dz: 0.12\n      triple_dissociation: \"importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=0.95), recency NS (d_z=0.11), random NS (d_z=0.12)\"\n      imp_vs_recency_ratio: \"36×\"\n    result_rationale: \"Recency eviction 按 token 到达顺序驱逐最旧 token，完全不涉及 attention score 计算。因此 head pruning 导致的 score discrimination collapse 对 recency 无影响——pruning 后 recency 仍按同一确定性规则驱逐，不存在 importance score 退化为伪随机的路径。在 s025 下虽然 absolute perplexity 升高（因更多有效 token 被移除），但 low-phase 和 high-phase 受到的 compound interaction 增量近似相等，因为 recency 对两个 phase 的 eviction pattern 与 attention distribution 无关。d_z 略高于 s015 的 0.083 是因为更高 sparsity 下 noise floor 略增，但仍远低于 0.2 阈值且统计不显著。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Triple dissociation at s025 — Importance d_z=0.95 (p<1e-50), Recency d_z=0.11 (p=0.42, NS), Random d_z=0.12 (p=0.38, NS)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Paired median difference distribution (bootstrap B=10000) for three strategies at s025, showing importance distribution far from zero while recency and random center on zero\"\n    analysis: \"s025 recency null 结果与 s015 一致，排除了 'recency 可能在高 sparsity 下出现 phase gradient' 的替代假设。Triple dissociation 在 s025 完整复现：attention-score-based eviction (importance) 产生强 phase gradient，而 scoring-independent (recency) 和 structure-independent (random) 均为 null。这确认 phase-dependent severity 是 attention score pathway 的特有效应。\"\n\n  - name: \"recency_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"C11_recency_s030\"\n    description: \"Recency-based eviction at sparsity=0.30, n=100. 最高 sparsity 下确认 recency null gradient，完成全 sparsity range triple dissociation。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 100\n      model: \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\"\n      masking_method: \"recency\"\n      sparsity: 0.30\n      phase_gradient_median_diff: 0.041\n      phase_gradient_cohens_dz: 0.15\n      phase_gradient_p_value: 0.28\n      significant: false\n      low_phase_ii_median: 1.52\n      high_phase_ii_median: 1.38\n      low_high_ratio: 1.10\n      low_high_ratio_ci: [-0.15, 3.34]\n      comparison_importance_s030_median_diff: 8.48\n      comparison_importance_s030_dz: 1.13\n      comparison_random_s030_median_diff: 0.51\n      comparison_random_s030_dz: 0.18\n      triple_dissociation: \"importance SIGNIFICANT (d_z=1.13), recency NS (d_z=0.15), random borderline (d_z=0.18 NS)\"\n      imp_vs_recency_ratio: \"207×\"\n    result_rationale: \"s030 是测试的最高 sparsity，此时 30% head 被 pruned + 30% KV 被 evicted。Recency eviction 的 compound interaction 绝对值升高（因为移除更多 token 导致 perplexity 整体恶化），但 phase gradient 仍为 null——原因不变：recency 驱逐决策与 attention score distribution 完全解耦，head pruning 不改变 recency 的 eviction 目标选择。d_z=0.15 接近但仍在 0.2 阈值内，反映高 sparsity 下更大的 measurement noise（fewer effective tokens per segment, higher variance）。重要的是，importance 在同一 sparsity 下 d_z=1.13 是 recency 的 7.5×，定量确认效应来源是 scoring mechanism 而非 token removal 本身。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Full sparsity range triple dissociation summary — s015/s025/s030 × importance/recency/random, 9 cells, only 3 importance cells significant\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: d_z vs sparsity for three strategies, showing importance monotonically increasing (0.57→0.95→1.13) while recency stays flat near zero (0.08→0.11→0.15) and random stays flat (−0.05→0.12→0.18)\"\n    analysis: \"s030 是 recency control 的最严格测试——如果 phase gradient 是 segmentation artifact 或 trivial token-removal 效应，在最高 sparsity 下应该最容易显现。但 d_z 仍仅 0.15（negligible），而 importance 已达 1.13（large）。这构成决定性证据：phase-dependent compound severity 完全归因于 attention-score-based eviction 的 discrimination collapse pathway，recency control 作为 methodological innovation 成功排除了所有已知 confound。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"GPQA_cross_benchmark_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s020, n=198. 验证 GPQA 上 phase gradient 从 s015 单调递增。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      interaction_index_high_median: 0.038\n      interaction_index_mid_median: 0.31\n      interaction_index_low_median: 2.85\n      median_difference: 2.81\n      median_difference_ci: [2.45, 3.28]\n      wilcoxon_p: \"<1e-30\"\n      cohens_dz: 0.92\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high (monotonic)\"\n      median_ratio_low_high: 75.0\n      pass_fail: \"PASS\"\n      perplexity_high_both: 2.95\n      perplexity_mid_both: 8.6\n      perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA-Diamond 的推理链比 MATH-500 更长（n_tokens ~1.2M vs ~62K for 50 problems），且更依赖 multi-hop 推理，导致 low-sparsity phase（深度推理阶段）对 attention pattern 精度更敏感。在 MATH-500 上 DS s015→s020 median_diff 从 0.39 升至 1.21（3.1×），GPQA s015 的 low_median 已为 0.96。按照相似的增长模式但考虑 GPQA 问题更高的认知复杂度（多步推理更易受 compound interaction 影响），s020 low_median 预计达 2.85（~3.0× from s015）。GPQA 的 phase gradient 更强是因为 long-chain reasoning 在 low-sparsity phase 集中了更多依赖 precise attention routing 的 computation。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GPQA DS importance dose-response: s015 median_low=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.1 (monotonic)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA vs MATH-500 dose-response curve comparison, showing parallel monotonic increase with GPQA absolute values reflecting longer reasoning chains\"\n    analysis: \"s020 结果确认 GPQA 上 importance phase gradient 的单调递增延续。绝对值比 MATH-500 同条件更大（2.85 vs 1.21），反映 GPQA 问题的推理链更长、更依赖 attention routing 精度。增长倍率 ~3.0× 与 MATH-500 一致（3.1×），表明 dose-response 动力学跨 benchmark 稳健。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"GPQA_cross_benchmark_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek GPQA-Diamond importance masking at s025, n=198. 完成 GPQA 三点 dose-response 并计算 strategy specificity ratio。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      interaction_index_high_median: 0.095\n      interaction_index_mid_median: 0.98\n      interaction_index_low_median: 8.12\n      median_difference: 8.03\n      median_difference_ci: [6.85, 9.42]\n      wilcoxon_p: \"<1e-40\"\n      cohens_dz: 1.08\n      gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high (monotonic)\"\n      median_ratio_low_high: 85.5\n      pass_fail: \"PASS\"\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_s015_s020_s025: [0.96, 2.85, 8.12]\n      growth_factors: [2.97, 2.85]\n      gpqa_strategy_specificity_ratio: 4.2\n      perplexity_high_both: 4.8\n      perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n      perplexity_low_both: 95.6\n    result_rationale: \"s025 在 MATH-500 上 DS median_diff=3.99（s020 的 3.3×），GPQA 按相似倍率从 s020 的 2.85 增长至 ~8.1。Strategy specificity ratio（importance/random gradient）在 GPQA 上预计为 4.2×——高于 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× 但低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×。原因：GPQA 推理链长度和复杂度介于 GSM8K（短链算术）和 MATH-500（中等链证明）之间的某种模式——GPQA 的 multi-hop retrieval-heavy reasoning 使 random eviction 也产生一定 phase sensitivity（因长上下文中 random 移除的绝对信息量更大），但 importance 的 discrimination collapse 效应仍主导。Ratio ≥ 3× 满足 best tier 标准。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-benchmark strategy specificity comparison — MATH-500: 15-17×, GPQA: 4.2×, GSM8K: 2.3-3.8×\"\n      - \"Table: GPQA full dose-response: s015=0.96, s020=2.85, s025=8.12 (Spearman ρ=1.0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response overlay (MATH-500, GPQA, GSM8K) normalized by task reasoning-chain length, showing universal monotonic increase with task-dependent scaling\"\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity ratio vs task complexity, showing gradient from GSM8K (low, short chains) through GPQA (medium, multi-hop) to MATH-500 (high, proof-style)\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA s025 完成了第三个 benchmark 的 dose-response 确认。Strategy specificity ratio 4.2× 处于 best tier 范围 [3.0, 10.0] 内，且提供了一个关键的 intermediate data point：specificity ratio 与 task-level reasoning demands 正相关。这支持了 Discussion 中 'strategy specificity 是 task 推理结构的函数' 的解释——GSM8K 的短算术链让 random 也能产生 phase effect（ratio 低），MATH-500 的结构化证明最依赖 precise attention routing（ratio 高），GPQA 居中。Phase gradient 本身（单调递增）跨所有三个 benchmark 完全一致，确认这是 robust empirical finding。\"\n\n  - name: \"reviewer_evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"reviewer_scoring\"\n    description: \"模拟 EMNLP reviewer 评分，基于完整实验证据链评估 paper 的 empirical finding + experimental design novelty + mechanistic explanation 三支柱。\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_avg_score: 3.7\n      reviewer_novelty_score: 3.8\n      reviewer_1:\n        overall: 3.5\n        novelty: 4.0\n        soundness: 3.5\n        comment: \"The triple dissociation using recency control is a genuinely novel experimental design. Architecture-dependent specificity is interesting rather than limiting.\"\n      reviewer_2:\n        overall: 4.0\n        novelty: 3.5\n        soundness: 4.0\n        comment: \"Thorough empirical work with strong statistical methodology. Cross-benchmark validation convincing. Minor concern: 7B scale only.\"\n      reviewer_3:\n        overall: 3.5\n        novelty: 4.0\n        soundness: 3.5\n        comment: \"Experimental design contribution (recency control) is the strongest novelty. Discrimination collapse explanation adequate but would benefit from causal intervention in future work.\"\n    result_rationale: \"Best tier 假设 reviewer 认可三个层面：(1) Empirical finding — 三模型两架构三 benchmark 泛化，n=500 高功效，全方向一致，reviewer 无法质疑数据质量；(2) Experimental design — recency control 作为 scoring-independent methodological control 无文献先例（H2O/StreamingLLM 仅用 recency 作 performance baseline），triple dissociation 全 sparsity range 成立，这是 reviewer 最容易认可的创新点；(3) Mechanism — discrimination collapse 通过 Gini/CV 跨模型一致下降得到支持，reviewer 接受 'sufficient mechanistic explanation without requiring causal intervention' 是合理的，因为 empirical finding paper 不需要 intervention 实验。3.7 均分反映：一位 reviewer 给 4.0（被数据量和实验设计说服），两位给 3.5（对 scale limitation 和 causal gap 有保留但不构成 reject 理由）。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Reviewer 共识：(a) recency control 的 experimental design novelty 被明确认可，(b) architecture-dependent specificity 被接受为 interesting finding 而非 weakness（因为论文诚实声明且提供了 quantitative characterization），(c) discrimination collapse 作为 mechanistic explanation 被视为 sufficient（不要求 causal intervention），(d) 7B scale limitation 被 acknowledged 但不构成 rejection 理由因为有三模型两架构三 benchmark 覆盖。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"cfd87b54-90b3-4c17-a025-1a70c61bd83b","total_cost_usd":0.57612525,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58727,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":5999,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":58727,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":5999,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":58727,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1